1086
01:04:00,733 --> 01:04:03,193
Oh, Torrance

1087
01:04:03,194 --> 01:04:06,321
Can't stand your cheerleading squad

1088
01:04:06,322 --> 01:04:09,824
But I love your pom-poms

1089
