One, two, three, four!

1091
01:04:20,878 --> 01:04:24,881
Yeah, you got me to feel
all those butterflies inside

1092
01:04:24,882 --> 01:04:27,258
In your locker I would hide

1093
01:04:27,259 --> 01:04:30,136
The truth,
It's only you I see

1094
