And you're just what I need

1095
01:04:32,390 --> 01:04:35,016
I'd bring you flowers everyday

1096
01:04:35,017 --> 01:04:37,602
Just to roll you in the hay

1097
01:04:37,603 --> 01:04:40,313
Well, I'm feeling fine
I'm right on time

1098
01:04:40,314 --> 01:04:44,192
I know I'll get my way

1099
01:04:44,193 --> 01:04:49,322
And you're just what I need

1100
01:04:49,323 --> 01:04:52,117
Not everything works as it seems

1101
01:04:52,118 --> 01:04:54,536
Is that so hard to believe?

1102
01:04:54,537 --> 01:04:56,996
'Cause you're just what I need

1103
01:04:56,997 --> 01:04:59,582
And you're just what I need

1104
01:04:59,583 --> 01:05:02,335
Not everything works as it seems

1105
01:05:02,336 --> 01:05:04,838
Is that so hard to believe?

1106
01:05:04,839 --> 01:05:06,632
