1243
01:11:26,678 --> 01:11:28,551
Well, you know what?

1244
01:11:33,310 --> 01:11:34,636
We don't need you.

1245
01:11:34,645 --> 01:11:36,229
Why do you have to be so mean?

1246
01:11:36,230 --> 01:11:37,980
I'm just trying to do
the right thing here.

1247
01:11:37,981 --> 01:11:41,067
Look, I'm trying to be
strong for my squad, okay?

1248
01:11:41,068 --> 01:11:42,735
That's what a captain does.

1249
01:11:42,736 --> 01:11:44,695
Well, I'm a captain, too, you know,

1250
01:11:44,696 --> 01:11:46,648
