1252
01:11:49,993 --> 01:11:52,703
Then when you go
to Nationals, bring it.

1253
01:11:52,704 --> 01:11:55,748
Don't slack off because
you feel sorry for us.

1254
01:11:55,749 --> 01:11:57,917
That way, when we beat you,

1255
01:11:57,918 --> 01:12:00,211
